        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Stunning Flurry"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/round\n\nThe kurobozu makes two unarmed Strikes. If both hit the same creature, combine their damage for the purpose of resistances and weaknesses, and the target must succeed at a 22 Fortitude save or be stunned 1 (or stunned 3 on a critical failure); this save has the incapacitation trait."
            },
